# =============================================================================
# Crash Bandicoot Launcher — LEGAL / SAFETY .gitignore
# If something here looks "useful to commit", it is NOT. Sony/Activision own
# Crash. We ship TOOLS + RUNTIME only. Never push dumps or game-derived code.
# When in doubt: do NOT force-add. Ask before `git add -f`.
# =============================================================================

# --- IDE / OS junk -----------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~

# --- Build / publish outputs (never the release zip with a dump inside) ------
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/
publish-*/
publish-single/
artifacts/
# Generated from root icon.png by publish_release.py
CrashBandicoot.Launcher/app.ico
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
# Keep in-game ImGui debug panels (matched by [Dd]ebug/ above)
!**/Panels/Debug/
!**/Panels/Debug/**
x64/
x86/
*.appx
*.msix
*.msi
*.nupkg

# --- Retail disc dumps & images (THE lawsuit fuel) ---------------------------
# PS1 / generic optical
*.bin
*.cue
*.iso
*.img
*.ecm
*.mds
*.mdf
*.nrg
*.ccd
*.sub
*.img.bak
*.toc
*.chd
*.cso
*.isz
*.pbp
*.cdi
*.dump
*.raw

# RecompOne BIOS font resources required by the runtime
!RecompOne.Runtime/Bios/Fonts/font1.raw
!RecompOne.Runtime/Bios/Fonts/font2.raw

# Common dump naming (even without extension tricks)
**/Crash Bandicoot.*
**/crash*bandicoot*.bin
**/crash*bandicoot*.cue
**/SCUS_949.00
**/SCUS-94900*
**/SCUS_949*

# --- Disc overlay payloads (mod asset folders) -------------------------------
# Infrastructure may ship disc/README.md stubs only. Never commit replacements
# extracted from the retail disc (NSD/NSF/STR/XA/etc.).
examples/mods/**/disc/**
!examples/mods/**/disc/README.md
!examples/mods/**/disc/**/README.md
# Runtime mods folder at repo root only (bin/mods is already covered by bin/)
/mods/
# CatalogDiscovery texture dumps (local user captures — never commit game art)
/captures/

# Common Crash disc asset extensions anywhere (belt and suspenders)
*.NSD
*.NSF
*.nsd
*.nsf
*.VAB
*.vab
*.VH
*.vh
*.SEQ
*.seq
*.STR
*.str
*.XA
*.xa

# --- Recompiled / derived game code (derivative of retail EXE) ---------------
# Generated C# from the recompiler — create only on the user's machine
CrashBandicoot.Recompiled/**
!CrashBandicoot.Recompiled/README.md
**/_gate_regen/
**/_test_apply*/
**/_patch_*main.cs
game.recomp.dll
**/game.recomp.dll
**/game.recomp.pdb
# Accidental drops of generated sources anywhere in the tree
**/Recompiled/main.cs
**/Recompiled/Entry.cs
**/Recompiled/Stubs.cs
# LocalAppData legacy path (old builds) — never commit if copied here
/recomp/
**/CrashBandicoot-Launcher/recomp/

# --- Runtime / player data next to the exe ----------------------------------
settings.json
interface.ini
carda.sav
cardb.sav
save/
game/
*.sav
*.mcd
*.mcr
memcard*
*.srm

# --- Logs / crash dumps / temp -----------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.dmp
*.stackdump
hs_err_pid*

# --- Secrets / credentials (belt and suspenders) -----------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials*.json
*secret*
*apikey*
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# --- Native / tooling noise --------------------------------------------------
*.pdb
crash-*.dmp
minidump*

# --- Optional: local notes that might contain dump paths ---------------------
LOCAL.md
TODO.local.md
*.local.json
run.bat
docs/HANDOFF_MODDING_P3_ASSETS.md
docs/HANDOFF_MODDING_P4_TOOLS.md
docs/HANDOFF_MODDING_P5_HOTRELOAD.md

# --- Android launcher --------------------------------------------------------
# Android Studio / Gradle local state and generated packages.
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
**/.externalNativeBuild/
**/.cxx/
**/build/
AndroidLauncher/captures/
AndroidRuntimeHost/captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
